          <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
          <Name>Text57</Name>
          <Page isRef="4" />
          <Parent isRef="4" />
          <Text>5. Sketch/Lot Plan with Vicinity Map drawn to scale signed and sealed by a licensed geodetic engineer [Sec 302.3.a, Sec 302.11] and relocation survey plan and reports (4 copies)</Text>
          <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
          <TextOptions>HotkeyPrefix=None, LineLimit=False, RightToLeft=False, Trimming=None, WordWrap=True, Angle=0, FirstTabOffset=40, DistanceBetweenTabs=20,</TextOptions>
